# A closed loft held by a guide: loft_ring_guide.tlspr's ring through six
# circles round the z axis, and the guide sketch's six cubics going round
# over their tops, rising between them; the cubics picked with the mouse
# from above and made the ring's guide by Features > Guide Loft by
# Selected Curves; the group list after it; the solid
# checked, a ring of one face.
file $testdata/ui/loft_ring_guide.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view default
click-entity 100000
click-entity 110000
click-entity 120000
click-entity 130000
click-entity 140000
click-entity 150000
menu Features|Guide Loft by Selected Curves
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
dump
